Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,《爆睡！在梦的世界大突击》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.21,0:00:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,粉剃社长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这次由于我们公司的失误
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,给贵公司添了很多麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们诚心诚意的向您道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是双叶公司的道歉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,诚意还不够哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一件
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,脱内裤？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,川口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.25,0:00:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是低头道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,也不能脱掉内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:00:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来者何人？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是野原广志
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我超级总裁超人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,内裤是男人最后的尊严
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,把工薪族的自尊当做玩物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.69,0:01:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,银座的女招待的名片飞镖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.44,0:01:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.33,0:01:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.13,0:01:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,商务活动必须是从
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.25,0:01:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,相互坦诚开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,超级总裁超人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,总裁也不轻松啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂喂 停下啊 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了 糟了 糟了 糟了 糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们分手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,诶?为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.98,0:02:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我已经有家庭了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,小美伢 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.92,0:02:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,前超有魅力的牛郎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,城咲仁的拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,小美伢 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,即使是前超有魅力牛郎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,城咲仁的拜托也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.05,0:02:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.83,0:03:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.31,0:03:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,请停下 小葵大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,牛奶来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.06,0:03:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,长大了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,奶好像都不够了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 小新 不要乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,被娜娜子姐姐掏耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,说错了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.31,0:03:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我娜娜子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.36,0:03:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,娜娜子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:03:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,太有男子汉气概了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:04:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然蛋蛋还是光溜溜的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.20,0:04:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哎 娜娜子？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,梦境世界成功启动
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可以安心了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.52,0:04:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.76,0:04:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 你所使出的力量 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 是你全力的百分之几呢 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 迟早会开始百分之百尽全力的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 虽然那样会有些累 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 感谢的心意 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.76,0:05:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 和道歉的心意 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 要好好表达才行 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.73,0:05:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 这样就会变得坦率吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 从明天起我会认真起来的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.53,0:05:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 是吧是吧 睡吧睡吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 现在还是睡饱了再说 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 把我的心意百分之百 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 传递传递给你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 虽然还有百分之几的心意 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 练习的不够 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 把我的心意百分之百 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.57,0:05:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 传递传递给你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 你要一直元气满满的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 大家才能绽放笑颜 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,新之助 快起床啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的娜娜子在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么梦话？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是梦 是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那再睡一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,滚来滚去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,美伢传授的秘诀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.00,0:06:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,滚来滚去睡觉之术
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我才没有滚来滚去过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,明明做过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,来滚去给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,滚来滚去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,滚来滚去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,软绵绵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,滚来滚去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,软绵绵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,滚来滚去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,软绵绵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,和软绵绵没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,软绵绵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,醒了 醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,又要赶不上校车了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,快点吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天附近发生了追尾事故
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,8人受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,太恐怖了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,撞到蛋 8个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:07:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,100人因为飞机停飞滞留在了机场
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,100个人不许大便？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不准大便
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,全面停止大便
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真是大事件啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.07,0:07:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,之前的贪污事件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.09,0:07:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,审判结果出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,半露屁股吃饭？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不要做那种愚蠢的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.56,0:07:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快点吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这个已经解决了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.41,0:07:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,旁边越谷市的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,集体噩梦综合征
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是光做恐怖的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是引起了小孩的恐慌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,学校都停课了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真是奇怪的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,说起做梦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.69,0:07:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨晚做了个奇怪的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我在天空中飞的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:07:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,突然出现了一个巨大的鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,把我吞下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.19,0:08:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼？我也梦到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像也梦到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好像被吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵也梦到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大家做了同一个梦？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事情不可能发生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我好害羞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,做了什么梦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.60,0:08:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说 前超有魅力牛郎的梦也
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,牛郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,公寓啦 公寓啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是临时居住的公寓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊 那是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.37,0:08:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,小新家也做了那个梦？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看来不只是我家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好像街上的人都
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,做了同一个梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:08:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我和风间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在梦里融合了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别说这么恶心的话了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我画了新的漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是和越谷的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.15,0:09:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,集体噩梦综合征
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 现在春日部防卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,正在讨论很重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊 正男
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正在讨论关于
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,风间妈妈处理体毛的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,并没有说那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 因为是新画的漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 想让我们看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,请看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真是没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是狗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.94,0:09:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,喵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.67,0:09:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,原来不是狗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.61,0:10:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是我的自信之作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真没想到竟然不是狗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 不和他说实话的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.67,0:10:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是吉永老师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,初次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.09,0:10:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,大家看过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉大家一个好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,最近石坂先生晚归之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,夫妻危机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这哪里是好消息了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而且根本没有夫妻危机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 昨天晚上才
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.93,0:11:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,转校生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,今天向日葵班
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,来了一个新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.86,0:11:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那给大家做个自我介绍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.18,0:11:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.77,0:11:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这就结束了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,再说点什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,再说就是个人隐私了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.55,0:11:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大家好好相处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.47,0:11:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么态度
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不好相处啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然脸还说的过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,果然女孩子还是要可爱一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,刚转校肯定没有安全感
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去和她做朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,女孩子是辣韮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊 大家都色眯眯的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.48,0:12:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不要闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.47,0:12:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,会吓到小崎的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,并没有被吓到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,想和我做朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的话请看一下这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我将来想成为漫画家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得想看漫画了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里有啊 漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,去书店买吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,堆的比山还高
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我将来想成为政治家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.48,0:12:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,和我讨论一下日本的将来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很在意政治的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是年金方面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:13:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,去看电视报道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,比较容易懂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这个石头很漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,送给小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 闪闪发光
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.07,0:13:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,路上到处都是 去捡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.95,0:13:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,让开 你很碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快说对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都是朋友哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不跟傻瓜道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人 还政治家 漫画家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,捡石头什么的 像傻子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.24,0:13:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能变成朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.95,0:13:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大家表演能力还是太差了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是原野新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.04,0:13:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,内裤类型是前开口的三角裤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,擅长的技能是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.03,0:13:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股断筷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.72,0:14:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在我面前做这种蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.55,0:14:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只断一根筷子不够震撼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.43,0:14:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不是因为这个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什么吗 那个女生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.01,0:14:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,贯庭玉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这样短期入园的手续就办好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.35,0:14:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然时间很短
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但是能交到很多好朋友哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,能交到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是那个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.67,0:14:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,百忙之中打扰你了 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.01,0:15:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,又出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 好弹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,软绵绵的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不能吃哦 小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,美伢 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是梦还是现实
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.15,0:15:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.48,0:15:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这个球是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.61,0:15:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 野原先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不要闯进我们的梦里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 蜜琪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.03,0:15:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真讨厌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:15:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 席林
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.47,0:16:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,住嘴 笨蛋夫妇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.43,0:16:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,比什么都不很有精神嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是比什么都好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真是悠闲的家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有那么好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大家真的做了同一个梦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不像真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,意识相连
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.60,0:16:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,人类在意识深处是相连的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.58,0:16:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 来确认一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.09,0:16:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不要了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来是梦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不要拿我来试
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,反正是做梦想做更好的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:16:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,比如说成为漫画家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,人气漫画家正男老师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我是动感出版社的山田
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,请在我们杂志上发表作品
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,帮托你了 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.07,0:17:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是人气漫画家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真是有趣啊 正男老师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,成为了漫画家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那边也
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.91,0:17:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,想做什么梦都可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那我也来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,给日本的未来带来新风气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我 风间 需要大家的协助
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,风间 风间 我是风间 彻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我 风间 会成为大家的手  - 踏实
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.38,0:18:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真是朴实的男人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.35,0:18:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮要成为偶像
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都爱妮妮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.80,0:18:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不要哭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.76,0:18:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,阿呆呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:18:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哦?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,石头
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真是阴沉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要 我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哎 娜娜子姐姐在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,娜娜子姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不 娜娜子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要做好梦哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.84,0:19:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 这么小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.73,0:19:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌 仁 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 那个男人是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,做白天的电视剧一样的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是 那副打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.81,0:19:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是梦就不觉的羞耻吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.99,0:20:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因为有我存在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,才有你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因为你这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,才老是没有奖金
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.17,0:20:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是梦 怎么这么疼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.51,0:20:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那只鱼 怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 川口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.63,0:21:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,找我超级总裁超人有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,大事哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.97,0:21:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你从今天开始要从
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,超级总裁上退位了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,现在被开除了的话家里的贷款
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,赞成的人请起立
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,全员通过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 大妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.17,0:21:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 城咲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 大妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.19,0:21:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,今天在我们店的消费账单300万
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,请付清
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,300万
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.65,0:21:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还不起还不起  - 不要小看前超有魅力牛郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.37,0:21:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那么多钱出不起  - 站住
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛长哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅我 原谅我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 燃烧起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.78,0:22:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我梦里的爱心之家
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我的 我的美貌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.28,0:22:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 蜜琪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.77,0:22:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那个家伙是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.20,0:22:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,席林 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,席林
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要开除我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我很重要的私房钱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.58,0:22:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,放手 大妈
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.74,0:22:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,川口大人 请您大发慈悲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.29,0:22:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,果然大人的梦之球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.10,0:23:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,又小又没用
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.97,0:23:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好 这条街上小孩子很多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.77,0:23:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,把这些梦想能量收集起来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.68,0:23:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这条街上有什么让你在意的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 虽然全是些笨蛋小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.40,0:23:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,小新 不好好待着的话 不行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.98,0:24:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 全部交给爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.56,0:24:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.26,0:24:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.34,0:24:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快醒过来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.96,0:24:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的梦 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.86,0:24:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,集体噩梦 综合征
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.04,0:24:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在春日部也发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.29,0:24:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.46,0:24:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.21,0:25:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,真是清爽的早晨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,今天一天全力奋斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.40,0:25:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.92,0:25:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.14,0:25:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.96,0:25:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.12,0:25:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.60,0:25:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,睡的好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.26,0:26:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没睡那么好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.02,0:26:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.22,0:26:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,味道怎么样 小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.70,0:26:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃哦 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.08,0:26:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,超级银河
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.30,0:26:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.74,0:26:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要 我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.90,0:26:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一下子就来了个三连中
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.60,0:26:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真是好的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.18,0:26:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.38,0:26:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.82,0:26:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 妈妈说她做了很可怕的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.94,0:26:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我家也是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.98,0:26:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我家也是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.90,0:26:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不要紧 反正是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.68,0:26:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就算很开心也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.84,0:27:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.96,0:27:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨天做了个很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.38,0:27:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.90,0:27:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.50,0:27:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.70,0:27:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,想着能和你成为朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.68,0:27:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.14,0:27:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.54,0:27:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,时间是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.62,0:27:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,2.5秒
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.70,0:27:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,过了2秒了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.72,0:27:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.72,0:27:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那个孩子一个人看起来也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.08,0:27:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.54,0:27:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.00,0:27:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你再说一遍试试
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.79,0:27:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不要因为这些蠢话这么激动
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.59,0:27:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,让开吗 你很碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.42,0:27:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.82,0:27:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 能把脏手拿开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.22,0:27:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.02,0:27:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,转校生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.84,0:27:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真任性啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.36,0:27:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看 我放开你了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.40,0:27:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好像装着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.56,0:27:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真脏
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.70,0:27:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.50,0:27:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.86,0:27:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.10,0:28:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,让开让开让开 让开让开
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.99,0:28:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,让开让开
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.22,0:28:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,绕过去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在这
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.16,0:28:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.64,0:28:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.72,0:28:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.82,0:28:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫老师来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.68,0:28:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.98,0:28:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我去便便
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.32,0:28:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,之后再去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.09,0:28:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.06,0:28:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,无处可走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.42,0:28:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好好挠你的肋骨
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.68,0:28:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 别碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.64,0:28:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.94,0:28:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.94,0:28:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,像石头一样硬
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.18,0:28:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,拔不出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.42,0:28:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.02,0:28:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他 小新
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.92,0:28:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.04,0:29:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.96,0:29:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.92,0:29:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 松坂老师
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.02,0:29:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.04,0:29:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 明明只是做了噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.10,0:29:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.86,0:29:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哎 不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好像粘上了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.28,0:29:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是对不起 谢谢也不说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.08,0:29:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,向谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.46,0:29:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,向小新啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.94,0:29:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,被那种笨蛋救真是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.54,0:29:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.32,0:29:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是嘴硬
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.62,0:29:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.86,0:29:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果只是这样妮妮倒不讨厌你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.50,0:29:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,反正很快就会讨厌的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.92,0:29:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.72,0:29:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.72,0:30:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.88,0:30:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,青春啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.96,0:30:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.96,0:30:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.26,0:30:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,最喜欢爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.74,0:30:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真是好孩子啊 小新
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.16,0:30:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,川口 你这是做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.72,0:30:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,前辈作为老公被解雇了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.12,0:30:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,今天开始这个人就是我老公了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.84,0:30:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是川口新之助了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.14,0:30:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,假的 假的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.40,0:30:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,老公 振作起来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.08,0:30:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在噩梦里面 是梦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.56,0:30:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.44,0:31:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能逃出吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.80,0:31:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.70,0:31:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.92,0:31:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.50,0:31:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.76,0:31:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那个家伙真的是5岁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.74,0:31:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不挺好的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.98,0:31:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,反正是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.96,0:31:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就做自己想做的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.00,0:31:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.56,0:31:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是正男
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.38,0:31:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.82,0:31:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,正男老师 毛栗子头的小正男
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.10,0:31:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,发行突破1亿本了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.24,0:31:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.56,0:31:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.20,0:31:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还有好莱坞寄来的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.30,0:31:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,把动漫改编成电影的要约
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.82,0:31:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真是没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.88,0:31:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不要客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.24,0:31:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.76,0:31:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要做萌p的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.02,0:32:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在吸梦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.58,0:32:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.60,0:32:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.18,0:32:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,正男
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.38,0:32:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这样今晚的就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.12,0:32:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,已经全部吸完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.74,0:32:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,噩梦的力量在增强
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.48,0:32:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,梦境能量的消费量
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.78,0:32:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,比想象的要猛烈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.74,0:33:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不要担心 爸爸会保护你的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.76,0:33:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我画不出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.48,0:33:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不许撒娇
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.04,0:33:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,已经过了截稿期了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.06,0:33:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我画 你这个饭桶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.06,0:33:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孩子也陷入恶梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.40,0:33:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,集体事件啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.54,0:33:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,已经没办法工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.54,0:33:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好恐怖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.04,0:33:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真讨厌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.24,0:33:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.60,0:33:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那个空间在吸大家的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.08,0:33:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.84,0:33:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,为了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.16,0:33:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那个倒是不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.46,0:33:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真不可靠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.88,0:33:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你没资格这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.38,0:33:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,净是做些很下流的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.16,0:33:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是大事件
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.12,0:33:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.82,0:33:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.46,0:33:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.34,0:34:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,该春日部防卫队的登场了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.68,0:34:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 正男他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.76,0:34:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,人手不够
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.32,0:34:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.60,0:34:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那是海葵
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.06,0:34:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想到了一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.24,0:34:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎吗 还以为妮妮肯定讨厌的她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.32,0:34:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,女人的内心是很复杂的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.74,0:34:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,青春啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.44,0:34:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.84,0:34:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.86,0:34:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,中午好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.42,0:34:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是渡边厚史的建筑物考察团队
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.88,0:34:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不要理直气壮的说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.98,0:34:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不在家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.38,0:34:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是这样 我们回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.38,0:34:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,很野性的玄关啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.40,0:34:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.08,0:35:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,破旧的感觉好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.42,0:35:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 主人家
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.86,0:35:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么渡边厚史会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.90,0:35:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.36,0:35:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个入侵者
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.87,0:35:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.06,0:35:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真是暴力的家庭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.26,0:35:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.36,0:35:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,只是垃圾放置地
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.22,0:35:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.72,0:35:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎 要加入春日部防卫队吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.00,0:35:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你也知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.54,0:35:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在梦境世界发生了很麻烦的事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.92,0:35:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,加入春日部防卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.82,0:36:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一起去解决麻烦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.74,0:36:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.96,0:36:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你有不服输的精神而且也很可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.60,0:36:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,然后总是一个人看起来很孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.04,0:36:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你能和我约定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.86,0:36:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不会讨厌我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.62,0:36:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.80,0:36:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你就是春日部防卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,的新成员了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.04,0:36:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那这里就是春日部防卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.04,0:36:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,新的秘密基地了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.44,0:36:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么那么随便就
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.82,0:36:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.46,0:36:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里种很多花吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.66,0:36:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是高达机器人的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.88,0:36:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,驾驶席
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.58,0:36:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.48,0:36:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.58,0:36:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.08,0:36:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.46,0:37:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,再向右边一点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.30,0:37:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.10,0:37:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,春日部防卫队新的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.92,0:37:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,像往常一样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.04,0:37:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.44,0:37:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,春日部防卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.68,0:37:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,燃烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.40,0:37:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,燃烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.74,0:37:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,燃烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.16,0:37:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,燃烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.54,0:37:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到防卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.40,0:37:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,万绿丛中一点红啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.98,0:37:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,防卫队也变得高端了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.20,0:37:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.28,0:37:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,请手下留情
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.80,0:37:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的屁股很柔软
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.36,0:37:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了不要做这种傻动作
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,穿上你的裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.20,0:37:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.78,0:37:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,反对暴力
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.16,0:38:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有高达机器人的地基哦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.64,0:38:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 爸爸有在听吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.98,0:38:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.96,0:38:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好累呀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.56,0:38:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不要管我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.22,0:38:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为噩梦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.60,0:38:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.92,0:38:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.02,0:38:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,噩梦中的平胸老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.86,0:38:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,幼儿园明天开始停课了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.10,0:38:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为噩梦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.18,0:38:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.58,0:38:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,到底要怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.24,0:38:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,再让鱼吃一遍怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.70,0:38:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要说傻话了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.88,0:38:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.84,0:38:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:38:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.42,0:38:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,去梦境世界
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.36,0:39:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该说过不要
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.28,0:39:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,让人来我们家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.64,0:39:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他们擅自进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.74,0:39:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抛下同伴的话很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.66,0:39:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,只是徒增烦恼罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.29,0:39:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不要交朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.38,0:39:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是为了我好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道的 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.06,0:39:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让别人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.70,0:39:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,梦境世界的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.16,0:39:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怪兽 出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.66,0:39:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,动感光波
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.11,0:39:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哔哔哔哔  啊哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.96,0:39:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,风间好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.72,0:39:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定被噩梦打倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.56,0:39:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.80,0:39:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.04,0:40:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.02,0:40:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,麒麟？ 河马？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.14,0:40:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是貘
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.02,0:40:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.10,0:40:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是貘 你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.68,0:40:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么啊 貘
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.30,0:40:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.90,0:40:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.48,0:40:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是中国传说中的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.78,0:40:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,据说专吃噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.38,0:40:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大和田
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.66,0:40:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是护身符
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.86,0:40:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈给我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.36,0:40:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈现在在干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.90,0:40:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好慢哦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.36,0:40:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在想些事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.94,0:40:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,摆架子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.24,0:40:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎 昨天的梦境里哪都没有你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.00,0:40:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,因为大家都分散了 我就去找了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.14,0:40:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.68,0:41:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight baby
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.86,0:41:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮在开大型演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.54,0:41:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,小新做了中年大叔才会做的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.30,0:41:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,阿呆的话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.68,0:41:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.46,0:41:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.58,0:41:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.98,0:41:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来到春日部之后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.02,0:41:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,梦就开始变得奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.98,0:41:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你在怀疑小崎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.96,0:41:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那种事怎么可能发生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.60,0:41:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那么那个信号塔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.46,0:41:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不是接收电视信号的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.64,0:41:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么装置吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.64,0:41:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我们到房子里面看看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.74,0:41:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌 说这些话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.66,0:41:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是想进女生的房间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.02,0:41:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,风间竟然是肉食系的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.92,0:41:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不要插话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.96,0:42:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,风间
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.60,0:42:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎可是春日部防卫队的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.08,0:42:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,成员哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.30,0:42:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不会做这种事的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.72,0:42:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀 是为了保护春日部的和平和安全的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.04,0:42:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.94,0:42:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.14,0:42:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,又做噩梦了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.22,0:42:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.04,0:42:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那么该貘出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.04,0:42:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,会把噩梦全都吃掉的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.76,0:42:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.00,0:42:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.06,0:42:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.88,0:42:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过不要进这个房间来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.48,0:42:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这个好漂亮 像花一样
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.04,0:42:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托不要做傻事了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.66,0:42:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快点出去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.44,0:43:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.64,0:43:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很像花哦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.06,0:43:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.84,0:43:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎 快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.22,0:43:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎 小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.48,0:43:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么没戴这个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.86,0:43:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你为什么没戴这个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.50,0:43:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.20,0:43:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没戴这个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.12,0:43:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你就会被噩梦吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.04,0:43:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真的只是忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.38,0:44:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这个方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.24,0:44:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.78,0:44:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.06,0:44:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,都来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.72,0:44:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.60,0:44:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的台词
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.60,0:44:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.64,0:44:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,明明演唱会开的正热烈着
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.28,0:44:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,石头脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.80,0:44:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,大家太过悠闲了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.82,0:44:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.54,0:44:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大家的梦都会被吸走的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.66,0:44:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,去那边看看
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.54,0:44:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,梦好像都聚集在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.26,0:44:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,为了不惹人注意偷偷的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.16,0:44:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.72,0:44:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight baby
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.48,0:44:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.42,0:44:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮还没唱够
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.26,0:44:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.84,0:45:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在开快点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.28,0:45:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.50,0:45:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,风间会开车嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.40,0:45:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是说这个的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.40,0:45:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.58,0:45:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.36,0:45:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太大意了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.34,0:45:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说了不要交朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.36,0:45:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.38,0:45:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人不是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.18,0:45:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不会暴露的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.68,0:45:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.34,0:45:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好吵呀 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.06,0:45:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,滚去那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.22,0:45:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界是你制造的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.52,0:45:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.06,0:45:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.00,0:45:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.68,0:45:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,既然不是朋友那我就
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.98,0:45:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不当作朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.98,0:45:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来处理了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.72,0:45:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,反正这个街区已经完了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.58,0:45:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算干嘛什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.12,0:46:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗我们了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.86,0:46:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我最讨厌你了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.08,0:46:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵 我不是奶嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.74,0:46:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 反正得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.28,0:46:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.12,0:46:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这次落选的话 下次就要等到25岁之后了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.46,0:46:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我解释清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.54,0:46:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你背叛了粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.98,0:46:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这个照片是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.38,0:46:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,明明那么相信你的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.26,0:46:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.60,0:46:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那是友谊会上的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.24,0:46:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,燃烧 燃烧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.58,0:46:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,燃烧 燃烧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.56,0:46:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,燃烧 燃烧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.62,0:46:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.12,0:47:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,被拆下来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.52,0:47:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.36,0:47:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都说不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.30,0:47:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮可生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.30,0:47:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.84,0:47:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密基地没了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.20,0:47:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,交朋友游戏也结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.46,0:47:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法做普通的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.20,0:47:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,所以爸爸做了梦境世界
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.74,0:47:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,使用了你们的梦境能量
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.28,0:47:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,来保护我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.52,0:47:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.92,0:47:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.94,0:47:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上会离开这个街区了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.74,0:47:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,然后大家的梦就会回归正常
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.60,0:47:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.98,0:47:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算报警？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.78,0:47:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.64,0:47:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么不行
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.06,0:47:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为小崎又会变成一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.78,0:48:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我会救小崎的梦的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.34,0:48:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我也讨厌没有秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.30,0:48:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在我面前说傻话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.50,0:48:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你肚子饿了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.09,0:48:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,突然之间来的吓了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.70,0:48:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好 好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.94,0:48:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.98,0:48:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好像会马上来接
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.94,0:48:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来非常生气
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.24,0:48:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,该生气
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.26,0:48:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,的是我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.54,0:48:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,让人做噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.18,0:48:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.06,0:48:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,情况我们已经了解了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.76,0:48:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎 之后你打算怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.16,0:49:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.80,0:49:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想把大家卷入麻烦之中
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.50,0:49:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我也不想让爸爸伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.84,0:49:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.34,0:49:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我说了会帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.30,0:49:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.62,0:49:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就算这么说你要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.84,0:49:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.26,0:49:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,貘
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.92,0:49:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,在梦里找到貘
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.38,0:49:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,把小崎的噩梦吃掉的大作战
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.42,0:49:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然而
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.84,0:49:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是传闻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.68,0:49:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现实中没有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.74,0:49:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,梦里的话会有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.36,0:49:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.14,0:49:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,会有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.62,0:49:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎的妈妈说过的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.58,0:49:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.90,0:49:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那就有 一定有
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.64,0:49:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一起去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.16,0:49:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.88,0:49:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 就算为了孩子也太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.52,0:49:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经从小崎那里听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.64,0:49:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.82,0:50:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你们明白的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.04,0:50:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,警察和医生都没用
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.10,0:50:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我是在救这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.88,0:50:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,美伢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.64,0:50:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 声音真大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.90,0:50:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 不要再接近小崎了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.52,0:50:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.22,0:50:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那可以搭话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.68,0:50:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.66,0:50:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,多管闲事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.08,0:50:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.92,0:50:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那小鸡鸡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.50,0:50:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别胡来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.12,0:50:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,真搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.08,0:50:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.52,0:50:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在做什么 快点坐上去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.94,0:50:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.52,0:50:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点吃
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.06,0:50:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋 要把他打飞才行
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.80,0:50:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,饿着肚子是睡不着的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.04,0:51:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.62,0:51:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.02,0:51:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,打飞之后怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.56,0:51:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不是已经决定好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.20,0:51:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,“啪”一声就打飞
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.32,0:51:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,然后跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.68,0:51:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 我们根本就进不去那个鱼中
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.96,0:51:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,已经试了很多次了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.80,0:51:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说如此
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.96,0:51:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 爸爸妈妈明天到底要睡到什么时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.80,0:51:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,大人就该早点睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.22,0:51:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊 你一个小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.14,0:51:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,才应该早点睡
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.10,0:51:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.92,0:51:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.72,0:52:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,能使用魔法的做梦少女
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.74,0:52:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,小美伢 只有五岁哦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.72,0:52:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我是代表正义的广志假面超人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.44,0:52:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我有着这样的像孩子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.98,0:52:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,的父母 真是丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.30,0:52:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.44,0:52:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这么做都是为了救小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.98,0:52:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你还越说越起劲
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.30,0:52:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.22,0:52:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.96,0:52:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 穿这个没有什么意义吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.50,0:52:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,大人的梦境马上消失了对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.34,0:52:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是变成孩子后
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.04,0:52:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,梦境就不会消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.12,0:52:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就不会被那个鱼吐出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.72,0:52:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你连这都想不到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.88,0:52:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 也是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.32,0:52:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那就必须要做了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.84,0:52:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好 野原一家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.28,0:52:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.88,0:53:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.96,0:53:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,走了 小葵 小白
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.84,0:53:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.38,0:53:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.58,0:53:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你果然来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.58,0:53:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,橡果小子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.10,0:53:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你教唆了我女儿什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.28,0:54:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 好了 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.54,0:54:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,强制排出
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.06,0:54:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不得不使用珍贵的梦境能量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.92,0:54:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.44,0:54:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去找貘
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.76,0:54:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里出去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.64,0:54:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,貘
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.84,0:54:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那种东西是不存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.16,0:54:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别说这种无聊没用的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.96,0:54:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有的 妈妈说
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.00,0:55:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈说过有的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.36,0:55:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉打断你们谈话
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.48,0:55:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你能做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.60,0:55:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要想帮小崎的话就别吭声
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.80,0:55:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,让我吸取你的梦境能量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.48,0:55:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.68,0:55:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.96,0:55:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.44,0:55:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.76,0:55:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.76,0:55:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.20,0:55:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样哦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.80,0:55:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.92,0:55:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,出来了 出来了 出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.60,0:56:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵  你真是帮大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.44,0:56:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,害怕了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.84,0:56:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小新你不怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.44,0:56:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还是我妈妈比较吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.32,0:56:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.24,0:56:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,小新 小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.76,0:56:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.64,0:56:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是在某方面有点吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.92,0:56:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有这么笨的父母真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.56,0:56:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.80,0:56:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.52,0:56:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.04,0:56:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.16,0:57:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 小白
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.52,0:57:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 喂 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.56,0:57:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真的会没事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.96,0:57:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,或许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.36,0:57:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,从心底里把自己当做孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.36,0:57:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,相信自己有能做梦的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.28,0:57:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.96,0:57:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 有球了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.48,0:57:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙到底在哪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.48,0:57:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.48,0:57:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊 你不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.88,0:57:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么可能知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.20,0:57:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不停的问 真烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.52,0:57:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的制定作战计划吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.52,0:57:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,想着先试试看了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.76,0:57:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真是没毅力
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.24,0:57:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,找回纯真的心
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.24,0:57:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样才能找回纯真的心
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.44,0:58:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,闪闪的能量源啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.68,0:58:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,魔法少女 纯真纯真 小美伢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.12,0:58:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,召唤风 召唤人  召唤梦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.28,0:58:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,正义的化身
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.56,0:58:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,广志假面超人来拜访了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.24,0:58:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.36,0:58:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,总之 先去鱼头那边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.84,0:58:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.28,0:58:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真是作弄人的混蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.04,0:58:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是啊 都不能安心做梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.04,0:58:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,老公 纯真的心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.72,0:58:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一二三 好了好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.29,0:58:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,石头 剪刀 布
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.75,0:58:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,出 赢了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.88,0:58:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,出 平手
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.48,0:58:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,傻瓜在看 猪的屁股苍蝇停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.05,0:59:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.40,0:59:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一二 一二 一二
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.32,0:59:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.28,0:59:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.52,0:59:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,猜拳
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.71,0:59:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.96,0:59:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.20,0:59:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.36,0:59:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.40,0:59:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你能过来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.12,0:59:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,当然要来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.00,0:59:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我是春日部防卫队的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.80,0:59:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.36,1:00:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,小新 真厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.72,1:00:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.20,1:00:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎也是防卫队的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.68,1:00:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.40,1:00:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我这种坏小孩也可以进防卫队吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.88,1:00:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我经常被妈妈骂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.88,1:00:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是坏孩子联盟
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.76,1:00:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.24,1:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.28,1:00:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.44,1:00:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,风间你还有这种爱好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.36,1:00:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你这小子 小新
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.56,1:00:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.96,1:01:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.12,1:01:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.60,1:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,都来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.16,1:01:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不想做这种梦了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.80,1:01:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,让它消失吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.84,1:01:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只要找到貘的话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.64,1:01:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,貘
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.36,1:01:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.64,1:01:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.56,1:01:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不要不要
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.52,1:01:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.16,1:01:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.28,1:01:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.36,1:01:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都来了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.32,1:01:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去找貘
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.20,1:01:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,要一起吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.72,1:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你在耍什么花样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.00,1:01:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮 快
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.88,1:02:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,都没气色啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.52,1:02:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.60,1:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,放开 放开 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.04,1:02:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好好 说别人是笨蛋的人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.96,1:02:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,才是笨蛋吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.84,1:02:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.04,1:02:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.68,1:02:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是别乱来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.80,1:02:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那个孩子的心情吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.08,1:02:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,自己的 为了保护自己的女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.92,1:02:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,说不出什么漂亮的话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.00,1:02:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,即使世界陷入不幸
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.40,1:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要保护我的女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.16,1:02:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 纯真心灵
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.36,1:03:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是强词夺理啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.12,1:03:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.00,1:03:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人死之前都有效
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.80,1:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,必杀技
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.04,1:03:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,鼻屎炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.41,1:03:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,暴走族
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.04,1:03:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真热闹啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.46,1:03:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,车子好才会轰轰响
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.88,1:03:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.71,1:03:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.51,1:03:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,车子特技
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.32,1:03:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,爱罗武勇
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.08,1:03:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,洲际导弹
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.44,1:04:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,放了个大屁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.88,1:04:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,请放心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.40,1:04:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,穿了衣服的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.04,1:04:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没有穿哦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.00,1:04:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 最恶心的梦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.72,1:04:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,前面是悬崖
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.84,1:04:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.16,1:04:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,跳 小白
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.04,1:04:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,请安心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.68,1:04:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.08,1:04:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,请别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.64,1:04:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.00,1:05:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.04,1:05:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.04,1:05:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 貘到底在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.16,1:05:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因为不知道才去找啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.80,1:05:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道在哪吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.24,1:05:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.88,1:05:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 某个地方一定有
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.44,1:05:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.24,1:05:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.12,1:05:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,能量被
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.84,1:05:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.64,1:05:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,躲起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.36,1:06:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,果然不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.84,1:06:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.48,1:06:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 小白
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.08,1:06:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.96,1:06:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,纯真纯真 小美伢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.00,1:06:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我打
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.20,1:07:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂喂
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.52,1:07:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你都偏离纯真心灵了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.40,1:07:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.28,1:07:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不行哦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.16,1:07:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.92,1:07:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,都被吸出去这么多次了还忍吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.92,1:07:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,必杀技
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.12,1:07:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,广志真空吸尘器
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.96,1:07:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,基本上都解决了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.12,1:07:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来是那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.60,1:07:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么大人也有这么多的能量
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.04,1:07:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们是为了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.56,1:07:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子做什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.20,1:07:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,特意给你看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.76,1:07:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真光滑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.52,1:08:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一根都没有留全剃干净了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.28,1:08:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,身心都很纯洁了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.76,1:08:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这样能找到吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.44,1:08:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你又默不作声吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.52,1:08:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.84,1:08:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.08,1:09:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧 小白
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.40,1:09:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,只能到这了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.16,1:09:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那走着去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.64,1:09:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,去找貘
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.56,1:09:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.92,1:09:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我适可而止吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.68,1:09:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,根本就没有貘吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.76,1:09:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,貘在那边哦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.64,1:09:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.44,1:09:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.52,1:09:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的都不会错
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.68,1:09:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我是原超有魅力的牛郎
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.52,1:09:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,成咲
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.68,1:09:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.44,1:09:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要感谢的话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.00,1:09:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,蚯蚓都有二十岁了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.52,1:09:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是貘
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.56,1:09:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.64,1:10:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.60,1:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,看不清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.88,1:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘 安静点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.20,1:10:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,久美子
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.28,1:10:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.56,1:10:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.56,1:10:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.56,1:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,大叔 你是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.96,1:10:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我嘛 我是貘
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.56,1:10:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是貘
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.40,1:10:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,也是大和田貘
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.00,1:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.96,1:10:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不知道我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.08,1:10:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我大和田家族的演员
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.64,1:10:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的粉丝
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.76,1:10:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可以给我签名吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.04,1:10:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等着
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.24,1:11:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对那孩子来说爱是必须有的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.92,1:11:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那样就不会做噩梦了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.32,1:11:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,明明自己都是父母
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.80,1:11:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,却不明白这个道理
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.96,1:11:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.88,1:11:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是你们没有弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.24,1:11:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子做噩梦的原因
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.08,1:11:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,最近 你好像有孙子了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.60,1:11:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.80,1:11:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,终于变成爷爷了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.76,1:11:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,之后又可以变可爱了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.56,1:11:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,再出现在公众视线里了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.56,1:11:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说过吧我不想  - 貘果然不存在啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.64,1:11:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.24,1:11:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 有是有
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.12,1:12:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,貘大叔 打败那家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.84,1:12:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊 突然间攻击吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.64,1:12:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,貘好像能吃掉噩梦哦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.92,1:12:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,吃掉那个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.00,1:12:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.92,1:12:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大叔你是貘吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.44,1:12:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我确实是貘
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.16,1:12:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.80,1:12:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.80,1:12:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只有貘大叔才能做到
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.20,1:12:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,除了貘大叔其他人都做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.68,1:12:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,貘大叔 貘大叔 貘大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.68,1:12:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了 真没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.88,1:12:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.96,1:12:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,貘大叔 貘大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.36,1:12:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真胡来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.92,1:12:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.08,1:12:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有其他办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.52,1:12:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题的 我相信貘大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.44,1:13:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 打扰一下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.96,1:13:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 能稍微冷静点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.88,1:13:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.36,1:13:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,久美子
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.04,1:13:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,貘大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.32,1:13:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.76,1:13:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.16,1:13:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.60,1:13:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.80,1:13:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.36,1:13:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎 小崎 小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.00,1:13:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.76,1:13:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.52,1:13:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.20,1:14:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.60,1:14:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.16,1:14:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那是噩梦吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.76,1:14:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.52,1:14:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.88,1:14:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,小百合
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.52,1:14:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.40,1:14:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.04,1:15:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.20,1:15:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,噩梦的本体是小崎的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.24,1:15:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这里么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.16,1:15:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.80,1:15:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.96,1:15:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.80,1:15:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮还没有来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.76,1:15:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我担心小崎 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.68,1:15:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.32,1:15:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这种东西
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.56,1:15:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.68,1:15:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.16,1:15:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这种东西 这种东西
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.08,1:15:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这种东西 这种东西
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.80,1:15:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 快住手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.32,1:15:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.60,1:15:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.92,1:15:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.84,1:15:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你们的错
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.84,1:16:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,明明之前都进行的很顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.32,1:16:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为你们小崎才变了的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.64,1:16:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.00,1:16:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有变
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.80,1:16:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,改变我的是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.96,1:16:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没有梦见噩梦的话
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.16,1:16:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.24,1:16:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,吸收大家的梦 搬家 再吸收
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.80,1:16:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 无论去哪
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.52,1:16:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉的时候 起床的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.52,1:16:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都只有我一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.52,1:16:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,一直一直都很孤单
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.60,1:16:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.64,1:16:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我的梦想是能交到朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.24,1:16:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,终于 实现了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.32,1:16:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,所以爸爸 拜托你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.00,1:16:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再把大家卷进来了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.60,1:16:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再让我一个人了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.16,1:16:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.20,1:17:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.04,1:17:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你住手
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.16,1:17:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎现在在被噩梦拉扯着
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.52,1:17:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果硬让她醒来的话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.12,1:17:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她的心脏会被撕碎的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.48,1:17:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,心脏被
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.80,1:17:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,没有别的办法么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.84,1:17:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,能做的事情都已经
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.32,1:17:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有能做的事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.64,1:17:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.04,1:17:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在那磨磨蹭蹭的干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.28,1:17:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快进入小崎的梦里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.28,1:17:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,把噩梦打败吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.80,1:17:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这没办法做到
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.44,1:17:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,梦境世界已经在削减了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.56,1:17:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,现在去的话太
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.00,1:17:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没有关系吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.16,1:17:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 大家
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.60,1:17:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.20,1:17:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的话一定可以进入的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.24,1:17:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,到小崎的梦里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.56,1:17:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有点害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.20,1:17:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,青春
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.52,1:17:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不要说这种傻话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.28,1:17:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们绝对要进入
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.00,1:18:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,春日部保卫队
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.92,1:18:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.64,1:18:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我睡在你旁边呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.88,1:18:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不许脸红
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.88,1:18:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,等着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.28,1:18:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.28,1:18:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为我插手了小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.20,1:18:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,的现实和噩梦了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.08,1:18:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你的做法怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.88,1:18:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,作为家长我很理解你的心情
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.84,1:19:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么把小崎送去妈妈的噩梦里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.20,1:19:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我的妻子
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.72,1:19:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎的妈妈已经去世了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.28,1:19:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,因为一次事故
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.52,1:19:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,梦境能量值超过了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.44,1:19:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,D程序的限
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.80,1:19:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,小百合
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.76,1:19:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没法停止 把间隔墙降下来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.44,1:19:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,炸掉它
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.80,1:19:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 又失败了么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.76,1:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.84,1:19:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.96,1:19:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不要靠近
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.12,1:19:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.60,1:19:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,从那之后
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.16,1:19:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎就开始被噩梦缠身
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.36,1:19:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得事情变成这样
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.44,1:19:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,都是自己的错
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.44,1:19:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,并且 妈妈会恨自己
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.04,1:19:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.24,1:19:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.16,1:19:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你的错
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.32,1:20:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.08,1:20:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.24,1:20:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,义气之石
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.36,1:20:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.20,1:20:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.56,1:20:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,来 站起来
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.16,1:20:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,妮妮 我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.36,1:20:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,约定好不会讨厌你的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.88,1:20:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,约定好了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.56,1:20:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话我们就和好了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.32,1:20:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.32,1:20:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,来了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.44,1:20:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心哦小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.36,1:20:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,突击
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.68,1:21:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 去那边
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.00,1:21:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.52,1:21:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,用屁股夹住了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.04,1:21:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.04,1:21:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你一点也不可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.76,1:21:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,从小崎的梦中消失吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.00,1:21:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.64,1:21:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那个是小崎的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.44,1:22:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,貘
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.56,1:22:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,把你全部都吸掉
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.92,1:22:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,味道有点重啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.36,1:22:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,再来再来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.32,1:22:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的 小新
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.08,1:22:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把它全部都吃掉
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.20,1:22:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.12,1:22:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.92,1:22:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 一个接一个的 烦死了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.32,1:22:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我来 我来 我来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.44,1:22:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.72,1:22:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得螃蟹很好吃很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.36,1:22:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也做梦吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.04,1:22:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在这样的状况下？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.12,1:22:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我要为了日本未来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.28,1:22:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在全世界中变得更强大
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.24,1:22:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,飞翔
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.80,1:23:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 我要变成漫画家
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.16,1:23:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,之后 那个
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.36,1:23:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊 在这偷懒
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.28,1:23:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,原稿怎么样了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.36,1:23:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.56,1:23:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,累死了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.32,1:23:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 小新
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.00,1:23:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,自由的做梦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.20,1:23:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 手不要停
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.56,1:23:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.16,1:23:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到漫画家这么辛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.20,1:23:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的这种梦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.08,1:23:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不要放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.72,1:23:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有这样一句话
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.92,1:23:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,笔比剑更强
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.32,1:23:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不许偷懒
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.48,1:23:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不要小看漫画家
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.12,1:23:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,狂妄自大
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.40,1:24:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这些东西没完没了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.16,1:24:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,让它脑袋消失
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.04,1:24:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,戳穿它
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.68,1:24:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.96,1:24:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,快躲开
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.56,1:24:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小行星
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.68,1:24:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,丝川
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.48,1:25:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快交原稿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.00,1:25:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看不下去了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.84,1:25:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,无法相信啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.48,1:25:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真的进去了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.32,1:25:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,能让噩梦消失就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.12,1:25:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没能消失
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.76,1:25:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.96,1:25:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我也进去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.72,1:25:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那样简单的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.36,1:25:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是孩子们之间
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.56,1:25:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有着一种超越了科学的羁绊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.28,1:25:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不是进入小崎的梦里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.08,1:25:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去小新的梦里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.00,1:25:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊 那样的话
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.40,1:25:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你要去做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.40,1:25:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一定要告诉小崎的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.36,1:25:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么睡法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.28,1:26:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是我的妻子 但好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.68,1:26:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 小新
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.80,1:26:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.12,1:26:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,噩梦呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.16,1:26:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可能消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.84,1:26:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,太好啦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.92,1:26:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真是傻呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.12,1:26:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,明显变弱了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.80,1:26:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,再把它增满吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.76,1:26:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,她是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.40,1:26:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.68,1:26:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,从前的我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.48,1:27:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 为什么要把噩梦消除掉
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.52,1:27:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为你吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.56,1:27:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为你做了傻事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.24,1:27:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈才死了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.56,1:27:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 不能让它消失
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.96,1:27:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你把妈妈的事情忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.16,1:27:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎才不是那种孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.68,1:27:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你真碍事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.20,1:27:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,请您放心
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.32,1:27:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有穿内裤哦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.12,1:27:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须要一直痛苦着
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.20,1:27:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是你的错
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.16,1:27:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈一直都恨着你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.92,1:27:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你的噩梦永远也不会消失
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.08,1:27:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,给我穿上内裤
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.84,1:27:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 你为什么来了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.84,1:27:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没有为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.36,1:28:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里都没有在孩子陷入危机的时候赶不过来的家长
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.05,1:28:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对家长来说孩子比自己更重要
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.51,1:28:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事情 你懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.08,1:28:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.96,1:28:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是你说出不想刷牙
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.44,1:28:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不想吃蔬菜这种任性的话吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.20,1:28:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.28,1:28:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为爸爸一直
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.28,1:28:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对孩子很温柔宠着孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.36,1:28:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.57,1:28:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你就不得不扮演
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.52,1:28:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这种被人讨厌的角色
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.16,1:28:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,即使被讨厌的话也好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.41,1:28:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,只是想保护自己的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.66,1:28:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些孩子是理解不了的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.59,1:28:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是 母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.88,1:28:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,她不会恨你的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.52,1:28:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.76,1:28:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.04,1:29:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,噩梦应该被这个貘消除了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.36,1:29:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.04,1:29:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起妈妈 都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.20,1:29:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为我做的傻事
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.12,1:29:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不是小崎的错哦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.40,1:29:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈才是傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.32,1:29:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,让你脸上出现这种悲伤的表情
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.68,1:29:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 回来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.48,1:29:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱的脸都被糟蹋了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.68,1:29:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈呢 最喜欢你的笑脸了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.96,1:29:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,无论我有多累有多少烦心事
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.24,1:29:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你的笑脸就被治愈了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.40,1:29:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以笑起来吧 小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.04,1:30:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈一直和都你在一起哦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.00,1:30:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈的梦里满满的全是你哦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.96,1:30:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是我的梦啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.85,1:30:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.85,1:30:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.76,1:30:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,骗人 骗人
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.76,1:30:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈不可能原谅你的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.56,1:30:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是个坏孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.72,1:30:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一个朋友都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.24,1:30:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直都是一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.04,1:30:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.68,1:30:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.52,1:30:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我会消失吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.40,1:30:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.08,1:30:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用消失
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.40,1:30:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可以一直在我的身体里哦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.92,1:31:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.16,1:31:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.52,1:31:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 大家
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.20,1:31:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.92,1:31:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,大家把噩梦打败了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.64,1:31:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不 噩梦还有哦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.16,1:31:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我已经能很好的应对了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.08,1:31:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.84,1:31:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,总之
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.92,1:31:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就是恭喜 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.84,1:31:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,总结的太多了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.44,1:31:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.76,1:31:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在这种煞风景的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.48,1:31:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能有祝贺的心情
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.48,1:31:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真是没完没了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.60,1:31:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,大家真是太拘泥于小节了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.48,1:31:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候都可以来的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.76,1:31:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.96,1:31:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,春日部防卫
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.24,1:31:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,等等小新
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.80,1:31:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,春日部防卫队
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.68,1:31:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,燃烧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.56,1:32:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,燃烧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.20,1:32:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎 这个好可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.60,1:32:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.04,1:32:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.80,1:32:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,防卫队的大家 都还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.72,1:32:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于习惯了这里的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.56,1:32:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,想起和大家一起度过
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.48,1:32:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,的开心的每一天
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.08,1:32:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好像做梦一样
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.96,1:32:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.88,1:32:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.32,1:32:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.24,1:32:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸为了那些为梦境而烦恼的人
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.88,1:32:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在大学工作
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.48,1:32:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然现在和大家离的很远
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.60,1:32:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但一定会什么时候在梦里遇见吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.04,1:32:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小崎
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.24,1:33:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在梦里遇见吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.96,1:33:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真美好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.48,1:33:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 今晚去附近看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.20,1:33:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.12,1:33:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.04,1:33:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,小新也
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.56,1:33:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 别靠着我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.04,1:33:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,睡着了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.00,1:33:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候开始的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.12,1:33:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.08,1:33:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易收到小崎的来信
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.48,1:33:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真是没有办法的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.28,1:33:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉长身体
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.52,1:33:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是梦见什么了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.68,1:33:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 以那个地方为目标大家一起前行 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.40,1:34:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 看见的都是笑脸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.03,1:34:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 其实没有变化的每一天 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.66,1:34:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 都是很重要的有着不可替代的意义 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.54,1:34:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果把大家做的事情都加起来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.96,1:34:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 就一点都不可怕了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.54,1:34:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 即使斗转星移距离遥远 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.46,1:34:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 一直没有改变的我们是彼此不可替代的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.84,1:34:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 如果你在痛苦的时候 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.89,1:34:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 身边马上会出现同样的朋友们 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.89,1:34:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 这比什么都能让人振奋 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.94,1:34:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 一个人无论如何也做不到的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.98,1:34:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 想起多年前 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.99,1:34:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 和你做朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.82,1:34:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 多次说起要继续完成之前的梦想 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.29,1:34:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 生活中不事只有好事 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.29,1:35:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 在这之前我们度过的每一天 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.51,1:35:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 现在也肯定会聊起的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.10,1:35:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 真的很感谢 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.43,1:35:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 朋友哦 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.43,1:35:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 可以互相说想说的事 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.94,1:35:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 只互相说想说的事情 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.11,1:35:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 因为想理解所以才争吵 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.32,1:35:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 才会理解彼此的心情 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.12,1:35:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 下次再见的时候 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.20,1:35:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 大家又会想要笑着 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.79,1:35:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 即使在梦中也想感谢哦 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.84,1:35:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 想起多年之前 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.47,1:35:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 和你做朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.18,1:35:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 多次说起痛苦的时候 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.60,1:36:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 生活中不是只有好事 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.52,1:36:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 在这之前我们度过的每一天 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.78,1:36:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 现在也会一直聊起的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.45,1:36:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 真的很感谢 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.62,1:36:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 朋友哦 ∮